exports[`§28.4 golden snapshots > root help after-text is stable 1`] = `
"
Common
  hotplug use claude --with grok/work   set default source
  hotplug use claude --with gemini/work Claude via Gemini proxy
  hotplug use claude --current          re-apply stored binding
  hotplug run claude                    launch with effective binding
  hotplug run claude --with openrouter-work
  hotplug current                       show bindings
  hotplug list                          accounts · gateways · clients · presets
  hotplug add account codex --current --name personal
  hotplug add account gemini --current --name work
  hotplug add gateway openrouter-work --provider openrouter --endpoint …
  hotplug reset claude

Projects
  hotplug link claude                   project binding from global
  hotplug link claude --with grok/work
  hotplug unlink claude

Proxy pool (opt-in multi-account)
  hotplug proxy pool enable gemini      one endpoint, many logins
  hotplug use claude --with pool:gemini

Troubleshooting
  hotplug doctor   hotplug completion zsh   hotplug update

Manage
  account  gateway  preset  proxy

Grammar: use|run <client> --with <source|@preset|pool:provider>
TUI: bare hotplug · g gateways · models on Proxy/Gateways · p multi pool"
`;

